WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.920
A lot of people think that.

00:06.920 --> 00:09.620
The evidence is there.

00:09.620 --> 00:12.280
The evidence is all there.

00:12.280 --> 00:22.520
It's, it's, come on, we spend, we send $18 million a year to Israel.

00:22.520 --> 00:24.080
Why?

00:24.080 --> 00:26.960
Just ask the question, what do we get out of it?

00:26.960 --> 00:27.960
Nothing.

00:27.960 --> 00:28.960
We get nothing.

00:29.960 --> 00:33.160
Are we doing humanitarian work?

00:33.160 --> 00:35.200
No other charge with genocide.

00:35.200 --> 00:40.000
They're killing off Palestinians.

00:40.000 --> 00:41.000
Are we helping them survive?

00:41.000 --> 00:46.400
Well, they've got a higher standard to live than we do, a longer lifespan than we do.

00:46.400 --> 00:53.680
Free education, free housing, free healthcare, or we're sending them money.

00:53.680 --> 00:56.040
Why?

00:56.040 --> 01:01.880
Ask yourself why a U.S. congressman can wear an Israeli military uniform in congressional

01:01.880 --> 01:03.520
chambers.

01:03.520 --> 01:07.320
I would think that would be an act of treason.

01:07.320 --> 01:09.280
But they did.

01:09.280 --> 01:11.400
Nobody said anything.

01:11.400 --> 01:17.640
Ask why the Israeli prime minister can bypass the president, fly directly in and speak to

01:17.640 --> 01:24.280
our congress without any other government interaction.

01:24.280 --> 01:25.520
I didn't know that could happen.

01:25.520 --> 01:26.520
Oh yeah.

01:26.520 --> 01:31.520
Netanyahu did, flew straight in bypass the president, talked to the Congress.

01:31.520 --> 01:36.600
Congress gave him 26 standing ovations.

01:36.600 --> 01:40.000
I think most pop stars would like 26 standing ovations.

01:40.000 --> 01:49.320
Our Congress gave Netanyahu a foreign prime minister 26 standing ovations.

01:49.320 --> 01:54.800
I have difficulty looking at that.

01:54.800 --> 01:58.480
In any other way, then, we're occupied.

